WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:06,620
Solemn, are you back?

2
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,420
I have something to trouble you. You just got home.

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,340
I saw no one answered your door and you were sleeping.

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:13,180
I might not have heard you with my headphones on. Wait for me. I'll go upstairs to find you.

5
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:22,260
give me your hand

6
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:31,740
I went to the military trading center in the afternoon to exchange some points.

7
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,780
I want your help to buy some thermal weapons. What do you want to buy?

8
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,460
Pistol, submachine gun, smoke grenade

9
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,260
Buy whatever you can, the more the better, whatever your budget is

10
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,780
Four million points, cross them all out

11
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:39,900
four million

12
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:40,940
It was transmitted to the base this afternoon

13
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,580
You are the rich man who is making the fuss

14
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:43,900
I found those metals by chance

15
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:46,740
I have been hiding outside before. You need raw materials and I need weapons.

16
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,860
Isn't it good to each get what he needs? You're really brave.

17
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:50,020
All the ideas were directed at the base.
